# Memory Bank Bootstrap

## Session start

Read in order before non-trivial work:

1. `memory-bank/projectbrief.md`
2. `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md`
3. `memory-bank/techContext.md`
4. `memory-bank/activeContext.md`

Use `memory-bank/progress.md` for feature status; `memory-bank/productContext.md` for UX/operator flows.

## Standards

Coding rules → `.github/copilot-instructions.md` only (SOLID, MVVM, C# style, OpenCV disposal). Do not duplicate here.

## Gotcha

**Test / Create / Viewer** → one template folder via `Config/setting.json` → `ComponentTemplates` (`ITemplateLibraryService`).

## After tasks

Update only `memory-bank/activeContext.md` and `memory-bank/progress.md` — incremental edits.

Entry point: `AGENTS.md`.
